### List tools
POST https://smartdrugs.com.br/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":"tools-1","method":"tools/list","params":{}}

### Get a profile (only some sections)
POST https://smartdrugs.com.br/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":"call-1","method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"obter_ficha","arguments":{"slug":"l-teanina","formato":"markdown"}}}

### Study doses
POST https://smartdrugs.com.br/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":"call-2","method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"faixa_de_dose","arguments":{"substancia":"creatina"}}}

### 24 hour curve
POST https://smartdrugs.com.br/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":"call-3","method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"curva_24h","arguments":{"itens":[{"substancia":"cafeina","horario":"tarde"}]}}}

### Read a resource
POST https://smartdrugs.com.br/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":"res-1","method":"resources/read","params":{"uri":"smartdrugs://ficha/bacopa-monnieri"}}
